{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ozmxcn","slideIndex":0,"text":"TD 星际环游 003／宇宙诞生，一粒六元。，小红书。https://xhslink.cn/o/4iQnld9ohQ6。图截自用户提供的录屏。\nTD 实时流体艺术，BIBIMOO_任任，小红书。https://xhslink.cn/o/8PmEOGMYmdJ。图截自用户提供的录屏。\n音画构思参考，Vivi S《TD 宇宙回响》。https://xhslink.cn/o/7NuVmtgTRWx\n天体特写中的星云节选自一粒六元《TD 星际环游 003／宇宙诞生》，取自用户提供的录屏。保留核心星云片段，按天体调色，并叠加实时颗粒。\n首页的长条尘带、太阳粒子弧和特写中的粒子球参考用户提供的图片与录屏。\n粒子实现参考，Bileam Tschepe《粒子扭曲效果》（授权中文教程）。https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ye4y1m7iv/ 。音乐频段映射参考《Audioreactive Particle Cloud》。https://www.elekktronaut.com/tutorials/audioreactive-particle-cloud-new 。\n总览：Computations in a Snowstorm by Scott Buckley (CC BY 4.0), 00:15–00:39. https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/computations/\n太阳：Aphelion by Scott Buckley (CC BY 4.0), 01:46–02:10. https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/aphelion/\n水星：Machina by Scott Buckley (CC BY 4.0), 01:59–02:23. https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/machina/\n金星：Petrichor by Scott Buckley (CC BY 4.0), 02:35–02:59. https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/petrichor/\n地球：Childhood by Scott Buckley (CC BY 4.0), 00:02–00:26. https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/childhood/\n火星：Resonance by Scott Buckley (CC BY 4.0), 00:14–00:38. https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/resonance/\n总览使用 Computations in a Snowstorm 的 No Cello 混音。所有片段均为 24 秒，做了截取、淡入淡出和音量调整。CC BY 4.0 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ 。作者使用说明 https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/using-this-music/ 。"}